@startuml LightEngineCurrent
' =============================================================================
'  LightEngine - AS BUILT on branch `cleanup` (read from the source, not the
'  design notes). Everything drawn here exists in include/ or src/ today.
'
'  Companion: architecture-proposed.puml  - where this is meant to go.
'  Predecessor: cleanup.puml              - status snapshot (done/partial/todo).
'
'  This diagram answers a different question than cleanup.puml: not "what is
'  finished", but "what actually runs when update() is called, and what is
'  merely compiled".
' =============================================================================

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members

